1
00:01:44,030 --> 00:01:47,740
[KING OF COMEDY]

2
00:01:48,479 --> 00:01:50,920
[Episode 3]

3
00:01:51,000 --> 00:01:52,039
Where are you going?

4
00:01:52,039 --> 00:01:52,710
Home.

5
00:01:53,590 --> 00:01:54,200
And then?

6
00:01:54,200 --> 00:01:55,150
Go to work.

7
00:01:55,990 --> 00:01:57,590
I have some talent after all.

8
00:01:58,950 --> 00:02:00,210
Wh-What are you doing?

9
00:02:00,790 --> 00:02:01,590
Don't! Don't!

10
00:02:01,680 --> 00:02:02,740
What are you doing?

11
00:02:04,040 --> 00:02:04,510
Come on.

12
00:02:04,680 --> 00:02:05,740
What are you doing?

13
00:02:08,750 --> 00:02:09,240
Bro.

14
00:02:09,840 --> 00:02:10,900
We meet again, bro.

15
00:02:11,630 --> 00:02:13,090
You're really something.

16
00:02:13,090 --> 00:02:14,870
Yudan and Shengzai were arguing like that,

17
00:02:14,870 --> 00:02:16,910
yet you still managed to make a video.

18
00:02:16,910 --> 00:02:18,640
And you even gained followers.

19
00:02:18,750 --> 00:02:19,610
You've seen it?

20
00:02:20,030 --> 00:02:21,030
Not a lot,

21
00:02:21,430 --> 00:02:23,120
but still more than they've gained
in the past 6 months.

22
00:02:23,120 --> 00:02:24,870
Yeah. I even followed him.

23
00:02:25,000 --> 00:02:25,460
Shut up.

24
00:02:28,150 --> 00:02:29,520
You've all seen it?

25
00:02:30,310 --> 00:02:32,190
But judging by the looks of things,

26
00:02:32,190 --> 00:02:34,320
you didn't come here to compliment me.

27
00:02:34,470 --> 00:02:36,150
I'll get straight to the point.

28
00:02:36,150 --> 00:02:38,960
Get out of Shapu right now.

29
00:02:39,480 --> 00:02:40,350
Bro, come on.

30
00:02:40,960 --> 00:02:42,150
What year is it?

31
00:02:42,150 --> 00:02:43,310
Let's not do this.

32
00:02:43,360 --> 00:02:45,090
We live in a society governed by law.

33
00:02:45,090 --> 00:02:46,430
Besides, I've got it rough too.

34
00:02:46,430 --> 00:02:47,760
I've already been paid.

35
00:02:48,560 --> 00:02:49,090
How much?

36
00:02:50,710 --> 00:02:51,840
I'll pay you double.

37
00:02:52,000 --> 00:02:52,800
18,000.

38
00:02:57,710 --> 00:02:58,240
Alright.

39
00:02:59,310 --> 00:03:00,440
I'll give you 3,000.

40
00:03:01,090 --> 00:03:02,020
Three thousand?

41
00:03:02,590 --> 00:03:03,720
You don't have to go.

42
00:03:04,180 --> 00:03:06,380
Just break up Yudan and Shengzai's deal

43
00:03:07,120 --> 00:03:08,250
and get them to quit.

44
00:03:10,470 --> 00:03:11,000
Bro,

45
00:03:12,240 --> 00:03:13,910
the education I've received

46
00:03:14,400 --> 00:03:16,290
doesn't allow me
to do something like that.

47
00:03:16,290 --> 00:03:17,120
I'm sorry.

48
00:03:18,310 --> 00:03:19,750
Are you stupid?

49
00:03:20,030 --> 00:03:21,430
Just take their money.

50
00:03:21,710 --> 00:03:22,910
I'll give you another 3,000 yuan.

51
00:03:22,910 --> 00:03:23,910
Ruin their deal.

52
00:03:24,030 --> 00:03:24,760
Understand?

53
00:03:25,079 --> 00:03:25,960
I can't do that.

54
00:03:26,250 --> 00:03:27,090
Bro, well...

55
00:03:27,120 --> 00:03:28,850
I already made a deal with them.

56
00:03:29,030 --> 00:03:30,360
I have 7 days to get 100,000 followers.

57
00:03:30,360 --> 00:03:31,470
If I pull it off, they'll pay me 18,000.

58
00:03:31,470 --> 00:03:33,120
If I don't, I'll get a guaranteed 5,000.

59
00:03:33,120 --> 00:03:34,190
100,000 followers in 7 days

60
00:03:34,190 --> 00:03:35,400
is simply impossible!

61
00:03:35,400 --> 00:03:36,840
The deal is already going to fall through.

62
00:03:36,840 --> 00:03:38,300
You can get an extra 3,000,

63
00:03:38,310 --> 00:03:41,040
making it 8,000 in total.
Isn't that a good thing?

64
00:03:42,630 --> 00:03:43,560
Add me on WeChat.

65
00:03:44,280 --> 00:03:45,240
I don't think that's a good idea, bro.

66
00:03:45,240 --> 00:03:46,079
Don't take it. Don't take it.

67
00:03:46,079 --> 00:03:46,360
I'll do it.

68
00:03:46,360 --> 00:03:47,710
Take it out. Come on, add him.

69
00:03:47,710 --> 00:03:48,680
Bro, you...

70
00:03:48,790 --> 00:03:50,450
I don't think it's a good idea.

71
00:03:50,800 --> 00:03:51,530
Chen Junnan!

72
00:03:54,000 --> 00:03:55,060
What are you doing?

73
00:03:55,400 --> 00:03:56,430
Zhen, you're here?

74
00:03:56,430 --> 00:03:57,190
I'm leaving then.

75
00:03:57,190 --> 00:03:57,710
What are you doing?

76
00:03:57,710 --> 00:03:58,470
Nothing.

77
00:03:59,750 --> 00:04:00,810
Nothing. Nothing.

78
00:04:02,470 --> 00:04:04,800
What's wrong with him? He's acting weird.

79
00:04:05,310 --> 00:04:07,130
He wanted to bribe me.

80
00:04:07,570 --> 00:04:08,810
But I firmly refused.

81
00:04:09,080 --> 00:04:10,680
I have professional ethics.

82
00:04:12,000 --> 00:04:13,080
But the relationships in the village

83
00:04:13,080 --> 00:04:14,910
do seem pretty complicated.

84
00:04:15,030 --> 00:04:16,070
It's okay. Don't be afraid.

85
00:04:16,070 --> 00:04:17,399
If they bully you again,

86
00:04:17,430 --> 00:04:18,430
I'll protect you.

87
00:04:18,680 --> 00:04:19,040
I can see that.

88
00:04:19,040 --> 00:04:21,390
You definitely
have some clout around here.

89
00:04:21,390 --> 00:04:22,680
So, did you see the video

90
00:04:22,680 --> 00:04:23,280
we posted?

91
00:04:23,510 --> 00:04:24,560
I did!

92
00:04:24,560 --> 00:04:26,800
I didn't know you had it in you, Mr. Zhou.

93
00:04:26,800 --> 00:04:27,310
Well...

94
00:04:27,920 --> 00:04:29,160
There was a misunderstanding.

95
00:04:29,160 --> 00:04:30,160
Trust me.

96
00:04:30,430 --> 00:04:32,000
Let's give it some time.

97
00:04:32,000 --> 00:04:32,460
Really?

98
00:04:32,830 --> 00:04:33,680
Give it a little longer.

99
00:04:33,680 --> 00:04:35,010
It might do even better.

100
00:04:43,920 --> 00:04:45,430
I—I didn't expect it

101
00:04:45,430 --> 00:04:46,510
to grow this fast either.

102
00:04:46,510 --> 00:04:48,950
But everything's going
exactly as expected.

103
00:04:48,310 --> 00:04:51,560
[25,801 New Followers]

104
00:04:49,270 --> 00:04:50,040
As I said,

105
00:04:50,190 --> 00:04:51,340
let's give it some time.

106
00:04:51,340 --> 00:04:53,630
That proves we're on the right track!

107
00:04:53,750 --> 00:04:55,360
-Yeah!
-Yudan and Shengzai are on the right track too!

108
00:04:55,360 --> 00:04:57,240
-Yes!
-Tomorrow, we'll keep the momentum going!

109
00:04:57,240 --> 00:04:59,840
100,000 followers
are just around the corner!

110
00:04:59,860 --> 00:05:01,690
Why are there so few comments?

111
00:05:02,510 --> 00:05:03,480
Maybe it was just too good.

112
00:05:03,480 --> 00:05:04,260
Everyone was too busy liking it.

113
00:05:04,130 --> 00:05:05,520
[Payment Successful]

114
00:05:04,600 --> 00:05:05,260
Exactly.

115
00:05:06,000 --> 00:05:07,190
They're just following us.

116
00:05:07,190 --> 00:05:08,480
Our followers are really loyal.

117
00:05:08,480 --> 00:05:09,940
That's what matters most.

118
00:05:15,590 --> 00:05:16,990
[Four Days Left] [26,000 Followers]

119
00:05:16,900 --> 00:05:18,860
Three, two, one. Action!

120
00:05:25,070 --> 00:05:25,830
Sorry.

121
00:05:26,120 --> 00:05:28,580
I've never seen her with long hair,
you know?

122
00:05:29,430 --> 00:05:30,030
Mr. Sheng,

123
00:05:30,240 --> 00:05:31,830
we've been filming for over 2 hours.

124
00:05:31,830 --> 00:05:32,800
It's only 5 seconds.

125
00:05:32,800 --> 00:05:34,390
Just try not to laugh for 5 seconds.

126
00:05:34,390 --> 00:05:36,240
Everyone's getting a little tired.

127
00:05:36,240 --> 00:05:37,040
Alright, alright.

128
00:05:37,040 --> 00:05:37,830
Stop laughing.

129
00:05:37,830 --> 00:05:39,360
Don't look at her eyes, alright?
Look at her nose.

130
00:05:39,360 --> 00:05:39,560
Okay.

131
00:05:39,560 --> 00:05:40,240
Five seconds. Come on.

132
00:05:40,240 --> 00:05:40,680
Sorry.

133
00:05:41,720 --> 00:05:44,120
Three, two, one. Action!

134
00:05:50,820 --> 00:05:53,270
I can't.
We've been married for so many years.

135
00:05:53,270 --> 00:05:54,430
It's awkward to look at each other
like this.

136
00:05:54,430 --> 00:05:56,330
We know each other too well.

137
00:05:56,360 --> 00:05:57,870
It feels so awkward.

138
00:05:58,070 --> 00:05:59,800
Okay, let's change the plan.

139
00:06:00,000 --> 00:06:00,750
Let's do it separately.

140
00:06:00,750 --> 00:06:02,190
I'll edit them together.

141
00:06:02,680 --> 00:06:03,480
Get some rest.

142
00:06:03,480 --> 00:06:04,040
I'll film Mr. Sheng first.

143
00:06:04,040 --> 00:06:04,920
-You can do it this way?
-Ms. Yu, take a break.

144
00:06:04,920 --> 00:06:05,680
You can do it this way?

145
00:06:05,680 --> 00:06:06,310
Yes.

146
00:06:06,600 --> 00:06:07,870
Sis, go over and fill in for her.

147
00:06:07,870 --> 00:06:08,830
-You can do that?
-Me?

148
00:06:08,830 --> 00:06:09,560
We can edit it together.

149
00:06:09,560 --> 00:06:10,120
Technology's come a long way.

150
00:06:10,120 --> 00:06:10,600
Come on.

151
00:06:10,600 --> 00:06:10,870
Don't laugh.

152
00:06:10,870 --> 00:06:11,600
Come on, Yudan.

153
00:06:11,600 --> 00:06:12,240
Come on.

154
00:06:12,750 --> 00:06:13,630
-You can do this?
-Take a break.

155
00:06:13,630 --> 00:06:14,600
Yes, yes.

156
00:06:15,040 --> 00:06:16,560
Three, two, one. Action!

157
00:06:32,920 --> 00:06:33,630
Nice.

158
00:06:34,480 --> 00:06:35,480
Pretty romantic.

159
00:06:36,130 --> 00:06:37,130
Stop.

160
00:06:37,159 --> 00:06:39,240
Cut.

161
00:06:39,260 --> 00:06:40,070
-What's wrong?
-Cut.

162
00:06:40,070 --> 00:06:40,600
Cut! Cut!

163
00:06:40,720 --> 00:06:41,430
Cut!

164
00:06:41,800 --> 00:06:42,310
Cut!

165
00:06:44,659 --> 00:06:45,650
[We were just acting]

166
00:06:47,409 --> 00:06:49,690
[Are you two in love?]

167
00:06:48,130 --> 00:06:49,330
I always thought

168
00:06:49,390 --> 00:06:50,430
that with my

169
00:06:50,430 --> 00:06:51,720
silver tongue,

170
00:06:52,720 --> 00:06:54,780
there was no one I couldn't convince.

171
00:06:56,680 --> 00:06:57,340
I was wrong.

172
00:06:59,159 --> 00:07:00,160
Completely wrong.

173
00:07:00,160 --> 00:07:00,680
Come on!

174
00:07:00,680 --> 00:07:02,120
What are you talking about?

175
00:07:02,120 --> 00:07:03,240
Yudan, don't get us wrong.

176
00:07:03,240 --> 00:07:04,560
H-How could he like me?

177
00:07:04,680 --> 00:07:05,540
You smell good.

178
00:07:06,600 --> 00:07:07,920
You... You think I stink, don't you?

179
00:07:07,920 --> 00:07:09,680
-What?
-I smell like fish.

180
00:07:09,680 --> 00:07:10,410
I stink, huh?

181
00:07:10,630 --> 00:07:12,000
I've had rhinitis for years.

182
00:07:12,000 --> 00:07:13,530
How could I smell anything?

183
00:07:13,630 --> 00:07:14,950
This is just perfume.

184
00:07:14,950 --> 00:07:15,680
You'd smell good too if you wore it.

185
00:07:15,680 --> 00:07:16,270
I'll give you a bottle.

186
00:07:16,270 --> 00:07:17,360
What's perfume?

187
00:07:17,480 --> 00:07:19,160
Perfume is a kind of cosmetic for women.

188
00:07:19,160 --> 00:07:20,070
You spray it on and you smell nice.

189
00:07:20,070 --> 00:07:21,200
How do you know that?

190
00:07:21,560 --> 00:07:23,310
Have you given perfume to other girls?

191
00:07:23,310 --> 00:07:24,160
When did I ever...

192
00:07:24,160 --> 00:07:25,270
Who did you give...

193
00:07:25,680 --> 00:07:26,920
Who are you in love with?

194
00:07:26,920 --> 00:07:28,390
You're being unreasonable again!

195
00:07:28,390 --> 00:07:29,480
Yudan, don't mis—

196
00:07:29,480 --> 00:07:31,950
Don't call me Yudan anymore, okay?

197
00:07:32,050 --> 00:07:34,780
Yu sounds like fish,
and I don't want to hear that!

198
00:07:35,040 --> 00:07:35,800
Tell me, who is it?

199
00:07:35,800 --> 00:07:36,720
No one!

200
00:07:36,720 --> 00:07:37,560
There's no one!

201
00:07:37,560 --> 00:07:38,750
Who are you in love with?

202
00:07:38,750 --> 00:07:40,120
Why don't you love me anymore?

203
00:07:40,120 --> 00:07:42,920
What did I do wrong?

204
00:07:42,920 --> 00:07:43,890
Fine. I'll tell you.

205
00:07:43,890 --> 00:07:44,560
I'll tell you.

206
00:07:44,560 --> 00:07:45,560
There's someone.

207
00:07:46,240 --> 00:07:47,300
She's coming soon!

208
00:07:56,870 --> 00:07:57,720
Yudan!

209
00:07:58,370 --> 00:07:59,000
Come on!

210
00:07:59,000 --> 00:07:59,360
Come on!

211
00:07:59,360 --> 00:08:00,960
Why are you wearing perfume?

212
00:08:04,920 --> 00:08:07,000
It's not my fault!

213
00:08:09,190 --> 00:08:10,310
Aren't there any other young people

214
00:08:10,310 --> 00:08:11,630
in this village?

215
00:08:25,990 --> 00:08:28,040
Why can't you two do it?

216
00:08:28,370 --> 00:08:28,870
Yes.

217
00:08:29,510 --> 00:08:30,630
Us?

218
00:08:30,950 --> 00:08:32,000
We've never acted before.

219
00:08:32,000 --> 00:08:33,480
-We don't know how to do it.
-Yes.

220
00:08:33,480 --> 00:08:35,000
No one knows. We're all amateurs.

221
00:08:35,000 --> 00:08:37,600
But your childhood friends
did it pretty well.

222
00:08:38,360 --> 00:08:39,750
I can't. I...

223
00:08:40,950 --> 00:08:42,789
I'll be the village chief someday.

224
00:08:42,789 --> 00:08:43,669
People will think

225
00:08:43,669 --> 00:08:45,030
I'm too simple-minded.

226
00:08:45,120 --> 00:08:46,120
-That's not true.
-You care about what people think.

227
00:08:46,120 --> 00:08:47,670
That point of view is outdated.

228
00:08:47,670 --> 00:08:49,550
I've done quite a bit of research
these past few days.

229
00:08:49,550 --> 00:08:50,870
A lot of directors of the tourism bureaus

230
00:08:50,870 --> 00:08:52,320
are making their own videos

231
00:08:52,320 --> 00:08:53,240
-in all kinds of ways.
-Yes.

232
00:08:53,240 --> 00:08:55,080
The chief of Chuanao Village next door

233
00:08:55,080 --> 00:08:55,790
has been doing a great job.

234
00:08:55,790 --> 00:08:56,480
-Yes!
-I even saved some of his videos.

235
00:08:56,480 --> 00:08:57,200
Show him.

236
00:08:57,200 --> 00:08:58,400
Find one and show him.

237
00:09:11,630 --> 00:09:13,090
This is quite impressive.

238
00:09:16,590 --> 00:09:18,670
Hello, everyone.

239
00:09:18,570 --> 00:09:22,760
[Fang Hua, Chief of Chuanao Village]

240
00:09:19,830 --> 00:09:22,840
I'm Fang Hua, chief of Chuanao Village.

241
00:09:23,240 --> 00:09:26,390
Welcome to Chuanao Village!

242
00:09:30,330 --> 00:09:30,910
What?

243
00:09:31,320 --> 00:09:32,450
Why are you so happy?

244
00:09:33,150 --> 00:09:33,880
You know her?

245
00:09:35,720 --> 00:09:36,200
No.

246
00:09:36,510 --> 00:09:38,440
Look. She's really good at martial arts.

247
00:09:38,440 --> 00:09:40,390
Their chief got in front of the camera.

248
00:09:40,390 --> 00:09:42,250
I'm... I'm afraid I'll freeze up.

249
00:09:42,360 --> 00:09:42,960
It's okay.

250
00:09:43,480 --> 00:09:45,280
How... How about we give it a try?

251
00:09:46,000 --> 00:09:46,930
Should we try it?

252
00:09:47,410 --> 00:09:48,940
Let's give it a try! Come on!

253
00:09:49,710 --> 00:09:50,320
Action!

254
00:09:57,750 --> 00:09:59,700
They... They can do it.

255
00:10:01,790 --> 00:10:03,320
Hey!

256
00:10:03,610 --> 00:10:04,570
Can you

257
00:10:04,840 --> 00:10:06,870
not go to work?

258
00:10:11,570 --> 00:10:12,330
Can you

259
00:10:12,670 --> 00:10:14,440
not go to work?

260
00:10:21,000 --> 00:10:21,790
Say the line.

261
00:10:22,480 --> 00:10:23,210
Say the line!

262
00:10:25,140 --> 00:10:26,930
Can you...

263
00:10:27,550 --> 00:10:30,080
Not go to work?

264
00:10:30,600 --> 00:10:31,930
Then can you support me?

265
00:10:32,080 --> 00:10:32,610
The line!

266
00:10:32,960 --> 00:10:34,690
Don't be nervous. Say the line.

267
00:10:36,670 --> 00:10:37,120
Oh my!

268
00:10:38,270 --> 00:10:38,750
This kid!

269
00:10:38,750 --> 00:10:39,480
Say the line!

270
00:10:39,630 --> 00:10:40,200
Zhen!

271
00:10:40,200 --> 00:10:40,720
Sister!

272
00:10:40,720 --> 00:10:41,240
Zhen!

273
00:10:41,240 --> 00:10:41,630
Sister!

274
00:10:41,630 --> 00:10:43,320
Look what you've done to her!

275
00:10:43,390 --> 00:10:43,960
Zhen!

276
00:10:43,960 --> 00:10:44,760
Call a doctor!

277
00:10:50,100 --> 00:10:50,900
How is it?

278
00:10:52,020 --> 00:10:52,500
Crack!

279
00:10:53,550 --> 00:10:53,960
Crack!

280
00:10:54,550 --> 00:10:55,120
Crack!

281
00:10:55,390 --> 00:10:57,150
Cut!

282
00:10:57,150 --> 00:10:58,080
Cut. Cut.

283
00:10:59,270 --> 00:11:00,270
Your performance

284
00:11:00,320 --> 00:11:01,840
is a bit too advanced.

285
00:11:02,080 --> 00:11:03,540
It's not something I can handle.

286
00:11:03,540 --> 00:11:04,760
So I suggest

287
00:11:05,530 --> 00:11:07,390
we keep using Yudan and Shengzai.

288
00:11:09,150 --> 00:11:10,010
Don't be upset.

289
00:11:10,050 --> 00:11:11,700
Focus on the overall situation.

290
00:11:11,700 --> 00:11:12,690
The most important thing now

291
00:11:12,690 --> 00:11:13,440
is to solve

292
00:11:13,440 --> 00:11:14,870
their internal conflicts.

293
00:11:14,870 --> 00:11:16,000
You go talk to Yudan,

294
00:11:16,070 --> 00:11:16,720
and we will talk to Shengzai.

295
00:11:16,720 --> 00:11:17,580
Let's split up.

296
00:11:18,030 --> 00:11:18,390
Okay!

297
00:11:18,670 --> 00:11:19,200
Let's go.

298
00:11:23,320 --> 00:11:24,360
Mr. Zhou, I have something to do.

299
00:11:24,360 --> 00:11:25,080
You go first.

300
00:11:25,080 --> 00:11:25,410
Okay.

301
00:11:32,960 --> 00:11:33,670
Don't get physical, bro.

302
00:11:33,670 --> 00:11:34,320
What are you doing?

303
00:11:34,320 --> 00:11:35,520
It's broad daylight.

304
00:11:35,600 --> 00:11:36,930
Let's talk it out, okay?

305
00:11:37,240 --> 00:11:37,670
Okay.

306
00:11:40,360 --> 00:11:41,360
Mr. Zhou.

307
00:11:42,750 --> 00:11:43,670
Have you decided whether to accept

308
00:11:43,670 --> 00:11:45,120
my offer to buy you out?

309
00:11:47,150 --> 00:11:47,960
This thing

310
00:11:48,000 --> 00:11:49,720
can record your heartbeat.

311
00:11:49,740 --> 00:11:51,510
I can listen to your heartbeat at home

312
00:11:51,510 --> 00:11:53,030
through these Bluetooth earpieces.

313
00:11:53,030 --> 00:11:54,090
So it's a recorder.

314
00:11:57,150 --> 00:11:58,000
About that...

315
00:11:58,910 --> 00:12:00,570
You should've said so sooner.

316
00:12:02,750 --> 00:12:05,080
You mean buying me out?

317
00:12:05,750 --> 00:12:06,910
Don't you like Zhen?

318
00:12:06,910 --> 00:12:09,110
Why are you trying to sabotage her plan?

319
00:12:11,360 --> 00:12:12,600
Listen carefully.

320
00:12:13,510 --> 00:12:14,910
It's very clear. I think.

321
00:12:15,150 --> 00:12:17,840
First, I don't like Zhen.

322
00:12:18,120 --> 00:12:20,150
She likes me.

323
00:12:21,240 --> 00:12:22,500
She's always after me,

324
00:12:22,550 --> 00:12:24,950
she loves me,
and she can't live without me.

325
00:12:25,320 --> 00:12:27,550
As Shapu's No. 1 nice guy,
village heartthrob,

326
00:12:27,550 --> 00:12:28,620
and true-love warrior,

327
00:12:28,620 --> 00:12:30,680
she'll forgive me no matter what I do.

328
00:12:31,550 --> 00:12:33,670
Second, do you know who's backing me?

329
00:12:34,030 --> 00:12:35,320
Mr. Huang.

330
00:12:35,870 --> 00:12:38,200
So I'm tearing those houses down,
no matter what.

331
00:12:38,200 --> 00:12:38,870
Third,

332
00:12:39,620 --> 00:12:41,220
I'll give you another 2,000.

333
00:12:41,380 --> 00:12:43,730
Just be my little mole.

334
00:12:44,910 --> 00:12:45,910
Do you hear me?

335
00:12:46,760 --> 00:12:48,380
Crystal clear. I think.

336
00:12:55,200 --> 00:12:56,200
What's your name?

337
00:12:57,550 --> 00:12:58,870
Chen Junnan.

338
00:12:59,390 --> 00:13:01,200
Chen Junnan from Shapu.

339
00:13:01,200 --> 00:13:02,530
It means a handsome man.

340
00:13:02,600 --> 00:13:04,030
A real man.

341
00:13:04,030 --> 00:13:04,490
Enough.

342
00:13:05,020 --> 00:13:06,440
I, Zhou Ke,

343
00:13:07,270 --> 00:13:08,330
refuse your offer.

344
00:13:08,720 --> 00:13:10,600
I won't join forces with the bad guys.

345
00:13:10,600 --> 00:13:11,630
I hate bad guys.

346
00:13:12,360 --> 00:13:12,960
Thank you.

347
00:13:14,400 --> 00:13:15,220
What is this?

348
00:13:16,070 --> 00:13:17,130
It's a "I Hear You."

349
00:13:17,270 --> 00:13:18,730
High-tech. It can record.

350
00:13:18,800 --> 00:13:20,060
I'll have Zhen hear it.

351
00:13:21,400 --> 00:13:22,300
Have Zhen hear it.

352
00:13:22,300 --> 00:13:23,030
Have Zhen...

353
00:13:23,080 --> 00:13:23,610
Let's go!

354
00:13:27,270 --> 00:13:27,750
Stop!

355
00:13:28,750 --> 00:13:29,240
Wait!

356
00:13:30,080 --> 00:13:30,550
Stop!

357
00:13:31,670 --> 00:13:32,150
Are you crazy?

358
00:13:32,150 --> 00:13:32,790
Stop!

359
00:13:39,080 --> 00:13:39,790
Careful.

360
00:13:46,240 --> 00:13:48,330
Yudan, I think you and Shengzai...

361
00:13:48,360 --> 00:13:50,270
Zhen, stop persuading me.

362
00:13:50,510 --> 00:13:51,910
You should get a divorce.

363
00:13:51,960 --> 00:13:52,670
You should.

364
00:13:52,910 --> 00:13:55,080
When things get tough, let's just give up.

365
00:13:55,080 --> 00:13:56,740
The best way to solve a problem

366
00:13:56,910 --> 00:13:58,440
is to forget about it.

367
00:13:59,630 --> 00:14:00,320
Zhen,

368
00:14:00,960 --> 00:14:02,320
you're my best friend.

369
00:14:02,710 --> 00:14:04,770
How could you tell me to get a divorce?

370
00:14:04,840 --> 00:14:05,480
Besides,

371
00:14:05,760 --> 00:14:08,390
when did I ever say
I wanted to solve the problem?

372
00:14:08,390 --> 00:14:11,120
The point is,
Shengzai isn't good enough for you.

373
00:14:12,200 --> 00:14:13,360
He... he's dark-skinned,

374
00:14:13,360 --> 00:14:14,840
and he doesn't like to shower.

375
00:14:14,840 --> 00:14:16,270
I have to say something about that.

376
00:14:16,270 --> 00:14:17,470
He showers every day.

377
00:14:17,790 --> 00:14:19,220
He's just naturally that dark.

378
00:14:19,220 --> 00:14:21,750
Well, didn't you also say
he thinks you stink?

379
00:14:21,790 --> 00:14:22,910
He wasn't lying.

380
00:14:23,150 --> 00:14:24,630
He really does have rhinitis.

381
00:14:24,630 --> 00:14:25,360
He can't smell it.

382
00:14:25,360 --> 00:14:27,220
You also said he can't do housework.

383
00:14:27,220 --> 00:14:28,670
But he's a great cook.

384
00:14:29,270 --> 00:14:30,600
He can cook all kinds of food.

385
00:14:30,600 --> 00:14:31,530
It's delicious.

386
00:14:31,960 --> 00:14:32,840
I'm hungry now.

387
00:14:34,510 --> 00:14:35,200
See?

388
00:14:35,480 --> 00:14:37,540
You actually have it all figured out.

389
00:14:38,080 --> 00:14:39,720
Shengzai actually
has a lot of good qualities.

390
00:14:39,720 --> 00:14:41,000
And he treats you pretty well.

391
00:14:41,000 --> 00:14:42,460
So don't feel sad anymore.

392
00:14:43,720 --> 00:14:44,480
Zhen.

393
00:14:45,480 --> 00:14:46,610
You're so nice to me.

394
00:14:46,910 --> 00:14:48,370
You've done so much for me.

395
00:14:49,000 --> 00:14:50,240
We are friends.

396
00:14:52,360 --> 00:14:53,080
If it weren't for you,

397
00:14:53,080 --> 00:14:54,630
I wouldn't know what to do.

398
00:14:56,840 --> 00:14:58,370
How about we go back and eat?

399
00:14:59,240 --> 00:14:59,770
Let's go.

400
00:15:01,720 --> 00:15:02,790
Zhen...

401
00:15:05,150 --> 00:15:06,030
Zhen...

402
00:15:11,640 --> 00:15:12,120
Stop!

403
00:15:13,150 --> 00:15:13,630
Stop!

404
00:15:14,630 --> 00:15:15,270
Stop!

405
00:15:24,260 --> 00:15:25,460
Isn't that Shengzai?

406
00:15:29,320 --> 00:15:32,030
Why is he wearing the suit
we got married in?

407
00:15:36,600 --> 00:15:38,330
Let's go. Let's go. Follow him!

408
00:15:38,600 --> 00:15:39,000
Why...

409
00:15:39,200 --> 00:15:40,000
Why is he wearing that?

410
00:15:40,000 --> 00:15:40,790
Where is he going?

411
00:15:40,790 --> 00:15:41,840
Is he going to...

412
00:15:42,550 --> 00:15:43,580
Is he going to...

413
00:15:58,000 --> 00:15:59,400
He must be cheating on me.

414
00:15:59,630 --> 00:16:00,910
He...

415
00:16:00,910 --> 00:16:02,320
He never lied to me.

416
00:16:02,320 --> 00:16:03,720
He was telling the truth.

417
00:16:04,150 --> 00:16:05,200
Don't think too much.

418
00:16:05,200 --> 00:16:06,510
Let's look on the bright side.

419
00:16:06,510 --> 00:16:08,440
So I'm supposed to think
he put on that suit

420
00:16:08,440 --> 00:16:09,200
to work here?

421
00:16:14,860 --> 00:16:16,750
Yudan, don't do anything rash then.

422
00:16:16,750 --> 00:16:18,880
We'll see if I should do anything rash.

423
00:16:19,870 --> 00:16:20,800
There's a smell.

424
00:16:21,130 --> 00:16:21,960
It smells like my house.

425
00:16:21,960 --> 00:16:22,550
This way.

426
00:16:22,830 --> 00:16:24,030
Keep your voice down.

427
00:16:24,750 --> 00:16:25,590
Careful.

428
00:16:33,670 --> 00:16:34,270
It's here!

429
00:16:36,000 --> 00:16:36,660
Over there!

430
00:16:37,040 --> 00:16:37,960
Here!

431
00:16:44,480 --> 00:16:45,410
Why are you here?

432
00:16:45,670 --> 00:16:47,360
You big...

433
00:16:48,000 --> 00:16:48,530
cheater!

434
00:16:48,790 --> 00:16:49,270
You...

435
00:16:49,270 --> 00:16:50,120
He's cheating on me!

436
00:16:50,120 --> 00:16:51,120
Yudan, calm down!

437
00:16:51,120 --> 00:16:51,840
Calm down, Yudan!

438
00:16:51,840 --> 00:16:53,640
So you really are cheating on me?

439
00:16:56,130 --> 00:16:59,130
It's not what you think!

440
00:16:59,200 --> 00:17:00,720
Listen to me!

441
00:17:03,000 --> 00:17:03,330
Okay!

442
00:17:03,480 --> 00:17:05,940
And we will talk to Shengzai.
Let's split up.

443
00:17:09,270 --> 00:17:09,680
Mr. Zhou,

444
00:17:09,680 --> 00:17:10,510
I have something to do.

445
00:17:10,510 --> 00:17:11,240
You go first.

446
00:17:23,280 --> 00:17:26,280
I feel so wronged!

447
00:17:29,990 --> 00:17:33,320
Why did she say that about me?

448
00:17:36,680 --> 00:17:37,410
Stop crying.

449
00:17:37,750 --> 00:17:38,790
Stop crying?

450
00:17:38,790 --> 00:17:40,110
I wanted to cry just now.

451
00:17:40,110 --> 00:17:41,240
There were too many people around.

452
00:17:41,240 --> 00:17:43,350
I didn't want to embarrass her,
so I held it in.

453
00:17:43,350 --> 00:17:44,750
That's my boy.

454
00:17:44,750 --> 00:17:46,590
I feel so wronged.

455
00:17:46,880 --> 00:17:47,310
How...

456
00:17:47,310 --> 00:17:49,070
How could she say I'm having an affair?

457
00:17:49,070 --> 00:17:51,000
I don't even look at the hens
when they lay eggs in the village!

458
00:17:51,000 --> 00:17:52,270
How could she say that about me?

459
00:17:52,270 --> 00:17:54,330
Good. You don't even look at the hens.

460
00:17:55,160 --> 00:17:57,270
No, I can't keep this bottled up.

461
00:17:57,350 --> 00:17:58,240
I'm going to find her now!

462
00:17:58,240 --> 00:17:59,110
I'll go find her!

463
00:17:59,110 --> 00:18:00,200
Don't. Listen to me.

464
00:18:00,200 --> 00:18:00,960
Don't. If...

465
00:18:01,240 --> 00:18:01,960
If you go now,

466
00:18:01,960 --> 00:18:03,070
you two will just start arguing again.

467
00:18:03,070 --> 00:18:03,920
Then it'll be even worse.

468
00:18:03,920 --> 00:18:05,310
Well, we can always get divorced!

469
00:18:05,310 --> 00:18:06,480
Divorced?

470
00:18:06,480 --> 00:18:09,110
I can't live without her...

471
00:18:11,750 --> 00:18:14,830
I can't live without her!

472
00:18:17,110 --> 00:18:18,110
Alright, come on.

473
00:18:18,350 --> 00:18:20,380
What should I do, Mr. Zhou?

474
00:18:20,400 --> 00:18:21,660
You two love each other

475
00:18:21,920 --> 00:18:23,070
so much,

476
00:18:23,240 --> 00:18:24,450
yet you're both miserable.

477
00:18:24,450 --> 00:18:25,110
What does that tell you?

478
00:18:25,110 --> 00:18:26,590
What does it mean?

479
00:18:26,590 --> 00:18:27,750
Both of you have problems.

480
00:18:27,750 --> 00:18:29,590
Maybe we're just not meant to be!

481
00:18:29,590 --> 00:18:30,550
You are meant to be.

482
00:18:30,550 --> 00:18:32,030
Alright, alright.

483
00:18:32,470 --> 00:18:34,240
Listen, she's got it hard too.

484
00:18:34,240 --> 00:18:36,200
A girl going out to sea to fish
to support you...

485
00:18:36,200 --> 00:18:37,350
Of course she'd feel wronged.

486
00:18:37,350 --> 00:18:39,000
You think I don't do anything?

487
00:18:39,000 --> 00:18:41,480
The table, the floor, the whole house—

488
00:18:41,960 --> 00:18:42,890
can't she see it?

489
00:18:43,030 --> 00:18:44,200
Of course she can.

490
00:18:44,200 --> 00:18:45,660
But you don't have to
always say it out loud.

491
00:18:45,660 --> 00:18:46,720
What does she want?

492
00:18:47,160 --> 00:18:48,790
She wants me to smell it with my nose!

493
00:18:48,790 --> 00:18:50,310
I have rhinitis!

494
00:18:50,310 --> 00:18:51,160
That's not what I mean.

495
00:18:51,160 --> 00:18:53,290
You two are both very talented actors.

496
00:18:53,410 --> 00:18:55,110
What you're missing right now
is the right attitude.

497
00:18:55,110 --> 00:18:57,470
You need to show her
how much you care about her.

498
00:18:57,470 --> 00:18:59,010
How long has it been
since you held her hand?

499
00:18:59,010 --> 00:19:00,720
How long since you looked at her
with love?

500
00:19:00,720 --> 00:19:03,320
How long since
you said something sweet to her?

501
00:19:03,350 --> 00:19:04,920
What are you missing right now?

502
00:19:04,920 --> 00:19:05,680
Romance.

503
00:19:05,880 --> 00:19:06,640
Tonight,

504
00:19:06,640 --> 00:19:07,590
surprise her.

505
00:19:07,920 --> 00:19:09,240
Make a whole table of good dishes.

506
00:19:09,240 --> 00:19:10,200
Dress up nice.

507
00:19:10,200 --> 00:19:12,240
See? Wear your wedding suit.

508
00:19:12,350 --> 00:19:13,280
And do your hair.

509
00:19:13,360 --> 00:19:14,820
What's her favorite food?

510
00:19:14,880 --> 00:19:16,000
Sugarcane.

511
00:19:16,830 --> 00:19:18,070
How long has it been
since you got her some?

512
00:19:18,070 --> 00:19:20,310
Yeah, it's been years.

513
00:19:20,310 --> 00:19:21,500
See? Have you solved the case?

514
00:19:21,500 --> 00:19:22,630
Is it because of you?

515
00:19:22,680 --> 00:19:23,680
And you're blaming her?

516
00:19:23,680 --> 00:19:24,960
You should be ashamed.

517
00:19:25,920 --> 00:19:26,650
Understand?

518
00:19:26,720 --> 00:19:27,440
Yes.

519
00:19:27,510 --> 00:19:28,550
Make her dinner,

520
00:19:28,550 --> 00:19:29,240
dress up nice,

521
00:19:29,240 --> 00:19:29,920
and get her some sugarcane.

522
00:19:29,920 --> 00:19:31,000
Sugarcane. I'll go get some sugarcane.

523
00:19:31,000 --> 00:19:32,070
No, no, don't do it.

524
00:19:32,070 --> 00:19:32,720
You start cooking.

525
00:19:32,720 --> 00:19:33,400
We're running out of time.

526
00:19:33,400 --> 00:19:34,310
What if she comes back soon?

527
00:19:34,310 --> 00:19:35,790
I'll go buy some sugarcane for you.

528
00:19:35,790 --> 00:19:36,120
Okay.

529
00:19:36,350 --> 00:19:37,010
Look sharp.

530
00:19:37,030 --> 00:19:37,690
Look sharp.

531
00:19:38,920 --> 00:19:40,790
And stop bringing up your rhinitis.

532
00:19:40,790 --> 00:19:42,050
But I really do have it.

533
00:19:49,700 --> 00:19:51,760
Don't hit me. Bro. What are you doing?

534
00:20:10,270 --> 00:20:12,510
Did he go buy sugarcane or plant it?

535
00:20:12,510 --> 00:20:14,640
Isn't the chief's field full of it?

536
00:20:20,780 --> 00:20:21,980
Isn't that Shengzai?

537
00:20:25,150 --> 00:20:25,980
Here!

538
00:20:26,000 --> 00:20:26,520
Here!

539
00:20:27,750 --> 00:20:28,400
Who is it?

540
00:20:28,750 --> 00:20:29,550
I'm here!

541
00:20:31,730 --> 00:20:32,410
Over there!

542
00:20:36,750 --> 00:20:37,280
Who is it?

543
00:20:41,680 --> 00:20:42,350
Who are you?

544
00:20:43,210 --> 00:20:44,030
Here! Here!

545
00:20:48,200 --> 00:20:49,070
Who are you?

546
00:20:51,880 --> 00:20:52,810
Why are you here?

547
00:20:53,030 --> 00:20:54,790
You big...

548
00:20:55,480 --> 00:20:56,010
cheater!

549
00:20:56,200 --> 00:20:56,880
You...

550
00:20:56,880 --> 00:20:57,550
He's cheating on me!

551
00:20:57,550 --> 00:20:58,510
Yudan, calm down!

552
00:20:58,510 --> 00:20:59,400
Calm down, Yudan!

553
00:20:59,400 --> 00:21:01,200
So you really are cheating on me?

554
00:21:04,430 --> 00:21:07,390
It's not what you think.

555
00:21:07,960 --> 00:21:10,370
Here's the truth.

556
00:21:10,720 --> 00:21:11,160
Okay!

557
00:21:11,160 --> 00:21:12,020
Let's split up.

558
00:21:13,350 --> 00:21:13,880
Mr. Zhou.

559
00:21:15,160 --> 00:21:17,480
I have something to do. You go first.

560
00:21:21,550 --> 00:21:22,630
Meet me at the sugarcane field

561
00:21:22,630 --> 00:21:24,960
at the edge of the village
at 6:30 tonight.

562
00:21:26,830 --> 00:21:28,920
Ms. Fang, where are you going?

563
00:21:30,860 --> 00:21:31,790
Little Ms. Fang.

564
00:21:31,960 --> 00:21:32,640
It's none of your business.

565
00:21:32,640 --> 00:21:33,970
Mind your own business.

566
00:21:35,880 --> 00:21:37,740
Have you finished your homework?

567
00:21:42,590 --> 00:21:44,240
Well, you're still on your phone
this late?

568
00:21:44,240 --> 00:21:45,500
You won't grow taller.

569
00:21:50,240 --> 00:21:51,570
Have you walked the dog?

570
00:21:52,070 --> 00:21:52,960
Not yet.

571
00:21:53,070 --> 00:21:54,470
I'm going to walk the dog.

572
00:21:55,750 --> 00:21:57,720
Mom, at least take the dog with you!

573
00:21:59,010 --> 00:21:59,600
Fang Hua.

574
00:22:00,350 --> 00:22:01,000
Don't!

575
00:22:01,350 --> 00:22:02,440
It's me.

576
00:22:05,310 --> 00:22:07,240
Why are you here dressed like this?

577
00:22:07,960 --> 00:22:09,200
Don't worry about it.

578
00:22:09,790 --> 00:22:11,110
I did it willingly.

579
00:22:11,450 --> 00:22:13,120
To protect your reputation,

580
00:22:13,920 --> 00:22:16,480
this was the best way I could think of.

581
00:22:17,350 --> 00:22:19,810
After all, I'm on a date
with a village chief.

582
00:22:21,830 --> 00:22:23,640
This isn't a date.

583
00:22:24,640 --> 00:22:25,640
No one is here.

584
00:22:28,350 --> 00:22:28,810
Come on.

585
00:22:29,960 --> 00:22:31,510
I asked you to come here tonight

586
00:22:31,510 --> 00:22:32,880
because I wanted to tell you

587
00:22:32,880 --> 00:22:34,810
that what happened that night here

588
00:22:34,950 --> 00:22:36,550
was all a misunderstanding.

589
00:22:40,680 --> 00:22:41,810
Then what am I to you?

590
00:22:42,200 --> 00:22:44,160
You're someone I happened to save.

591
00:22:44,640 --> 00:22:45,440
I'm your "someone?"

592
00:22:45,440 --> 00:22:46,790
That night,

593
00:22:46,790 --> 00:22:48,680
those 7 or 8 guys
dragged you into the sugarcane field.

594
00:22:48,680 --> 00:22:49,830
How could I not save you?

595
00:22:49,830 --> 00:22:51,350
I was also trying to help.

596
00:22:51,720 --> 00:22:53,400
I saw those 7 or 8 guys
stealing sugarcane.

597
00:22:53,400 --> 00:22:54,800
How could I not stop them?

598
00:22:56,110 --> 00:22:57,640
Then why did you send me home

599
00:22:57,960 --> 00:22:59,220
and bandage my wounds?

600
00:22:59,720 --> 00:23:01,650
That was just a misunderstanding.

601
00:23:04,440 --> 00:23:05,350
And what about

602
00:23:05,640 --> 00:23:07,350
that time my boat broke down at sea?

603
00:23:07,350 --> 00:23:08,950
Wasn't it you who rescued me?

604
00:23:09,270 --> 00:23:11,550
I was just out patrolling the waters.

605
00:23:11,550 --> 00:23:13,070
And that time I was being chased by geese?

606
00:23:13,070 --> 00:23:14,000
Wasn't it you who saved me?

607
00:23:14,000 --> 00:23:16,110
I was doing poverty relief work
at the goose farm.

608
00:23:16,110 --> 00:23:16,920
And when I got hit by a car,

609
00:23:16,920 --> 00:23:18,000
weren't you the one
who took me to the hospital?

610
00:23:18,000 --> 00:23:19,480
Because it was my car!

611
00:23:19,640 --> 00:23:21,970
Of course
I had to take you to the hospital.

612
00:23:22,310 --> 00:23:23,000
See?

613
00:23:23,830 --> 00:23:25,110
Every time I'm in danger,

614
00:23:25,110 --> 00:23:26,240
you're there for me.

615
00:23:26,720 --> 00:23:27,680
Well, I...

616
00:23:29,200 --> 00:23:30,720
Did you do it on purpose?

617
00:23:32,510 --> 00:23:33,720
It's fate.

618
00:23:36,790 --> 00:23:38,650
So, after saving me so many times,

619
00:23:39,750 --> 00:23:41,950
didn't you develop any feelings for me?

620
00:23:42,600 --> 00:23:43,990
We're not right for each other.

621
00:23:43,990 --> 00:23:44,900
Why not?

622
00:23:45,440 --> 00:23:46,790
I'm a widow with a daughter.

623
00:23:46,790 --> 00:23:47,680
I can fit into your family.

624
00:23:47,680 --> 00:23:48,960
I'm a village chief.

625
00:23:48,960 --> 00:23:50,440
I can be a village chief someday too.

626
00:23:50,440 --> 00:23:52,070
The point is, you're this old

627
00:23:52,070 --> 00:23:53,110
and you've never even been
in a relationship.

628
00:23:53,110 --> 00:23:54,790
Maybe you should see what's out there.

629
00:23:54,790 --> 00:23:56,310
I won't! I only like you!

630
00:23:56,310 --> 00:23:56,590
Come on!

631
00:23:56,590 --> 00:23:57,640
You're the only girl I've ever liked

632
00:23:57,640 --> 00:23:59,770
in my entire twenty-something years.

633
00:24:01,030 --> 00:24:01,890
How old are you?

634
00:24:03,350 --> 00:24:05,160
Twenty-eight. Is that okay?

635
00:24:08,550 --> 00:24:10,480
So you're 10 years younger than me?

636
00:24:10,960 --> 00:24:13,160
I thought you were 8 years older than me.

637
00:24:15,790 --> 00:24:18,160
Kid, let me send you home.

638
00:24:18,160 --> 00:24:19,110
Come on.

639
00:24:19,110 --> 00:24:20,310
Age isn't a problem.

640
00:24:20,310 --> 00:24:22,170
We're from two different worlds.

641
00:24:22,640 --> 00:24:24,440
Let's not keep in touch anymore.

642
00:24:25,790 --> 00:24:26,550
Here!

643
00:24:29,000 --> 00:24:29,590
Here!

644
00:24:31,550 --> 00:24:32,550
Hua, run!

645
00:24:32,720 --> 00:24:33,590
If someone sees us, we're done for!

646
00:24:33,590 --> 00:24:34,790
I'll cover you!

647
00:24:35,070 --> 00:24:36,030
I'm here!

648
00:24:36,050 --> 00:24:37,100
Come and catch me!

649
00:24:38,310 --> 00:24:39,200
I'm here!

650
00:24:39,960 --> 00:24:40,490
Who is it?

651
00:24:42,160 --> 00:24:42,820
Over there!

652
00:24:45,070 --> 00:24:45,750
Who is it?

653
00:24:49,680 --> 00:24:50,340
Who are you?

654
00:24:52,030 --> 00:24:52,690
Who are you?

655
00:24:52,720 --> 00:24:53,850
Here! They're here!

656
00:24:55,550 --> 00:24:56,590
You big...

657
00:24:57,240 --> 00:24:57,900
Who are you?

658
00:24:59,270 --> 00:25:00,200
Who are you?

659
00:25:02,790 --> 00:25:03,720
Why are you here?

660
00:25:05,640 --> 00:25:06,440
He's cheating on me!

661
00:25:06,440 --> 00:25:07,590
Yudan, calm down!

662
00:25:07,590 --> 00:25:08,240
Calm down, Yudan!

663
00:25:08,240 --> 00:25:09,350
So you really are cheating on me?

664
00:25:09,350 --> 00:25:09,960
Run.

665
00:25:11,200 --> 00:25:12,000
Keep running.

666
00:25:13,160 --> 00:25:14,110
Mr. Zhou?

667
00:25:15,480 --> 00:25:17,000
What are you doing here with them?

668
00:25:17,000 --> 00:25:17,510
Zhen?

669
00:25:19,750 --> 00:25:21,960
We're playing a game.

670
00:25:22,880 --> 00:25:23,810
Hide-and-seek.

671
00:25:23,920 --> 00:25:25,400
Mr. Zhou, I got you!

672
00:25:26,920 --> 00:25:28,560
You think I stink! You...

673
00:26:09,880 --> 00:26:10,830
And you've never even been
in a relationship.

674
00:26:10,830 --> 00:26:12,440
Maybe you should see what's out there.

675
00:26:12,440 --> 00:26:13,270
I won't!

676
00:26:13,830 --> 00:26:14,750
I only like you!

677
00:26:14,920 --> 00:26:16,750
We're from two different worlds.

678
00:26:16,750 --> 00:26:18,550
Let's not keep in touch anymore.

679
00:26:20,310 --> 00:26:22,160
Fang Hua, I'm serious.

680
00:26:22,750 --> 00:26:23,880
Age is not a problem.

681
00:26:24,270 --> 00:26:25,030
Trust me.

682
00:26:26,240 --> 00:26:28,040
Let's not keep in touch anymore.

683
00:26:30,480 --> 00:26:31,550
Then what am I to you?

684
00:26:31,550 --> 00:26:33,160
You're someone I happened to save.

685
00:26:33,160 --> 00:26:34,030
I'm your "someone?"

686
00:26:34,030 --> 00:26:35,890
So, after saving me so many times,

687
00:26:36,510 --> 00:26:38,710
didn't you develop any feelings for me?

688
00:27:28,200 --> 00:27:29,270
Are you okay?

689
00:27:30,200 --> 00:27:31,880
Do you need me to keep you company?

690
00:27:31,880 --> 00:27:33,160
Don't worry about me.

691
00:27:33,880 --> 00:27:36,310
Don't tell Shengzai
I went back to my mom's.

692
00:27:36,310 --> 00:27:38,240
I don't want to see him ever again.

693
00:27:44,200 --> 00:27:45,000
The two leads.

694
00:27:45,480 --> 00:27:47,370
One got canceled, and one quit.

695
00:27:47,830 --> 00:27:48,270
Fine.

696
00:27:50,440 --> 00:27:51,680
Who got canceled?

697
00:27:54,790 --> 00:27:55,680
Mr. Zhou.

698
00:27:56,960 --> 00:27:59,110
What were you and Chen Junnan doing

699
00:27:59,110 --> 00:28:00,440
in the sugarcane field?

700
00:28:00,750 --> 00:28:03,480
You went into a sugarcane field
with Chen Junnan?

701
00:28:04,750 --> 00:28:06,310
He tried to buy me off again.

702
00:28:06,640 --> 00:28:07,970
When was the first time?

703
00:28:09,440 --> 00:28:10,570
I didn't agree to it.

704
00:28:11,110 --> 00:28:11,830
I have proof.

705
00:28:11,830 --> 00:28:13,290
Don't look at me like that.

706
00:28:15,550 --> 00:28:16,400
Where's my "I Hear You?"

707
00:28:16,400 --> 00:28:17,830
Where is it? Are you sitting on it?

708
00:28:17,830 --> 00:28:19,070
What is a "I Hear You?"

709
00:28:19,070 --> 00:28:19,670
That's...

710
00:28:22,680 --> 00:28:23,740
Nothing happened.

711
00:28:24,610 --> 00:28:26,850
I swear, we honor our contracts.

712
00:28:26,880 --> 00:28:27,680
That's right.

713
00:28:27,680 --> 00:28:29,080
If you don't trust me,
at least you can trust her.

714
00:28:29,080 --> 00:28:31,120
I'm still pretty trustworthy.

715
00:28:31,400 --> 00:28:32,600
That's not the point.

716
00:28:32,720 --> 00:28:34,180
The important thing is...

717
00:28:34,240 --> 00:28:34,770
Ms. Zhen,

718
00:28:35,510 --> 00:28:36,640
you don't have any actors now,

719
00:28:36,640 --> 00:28:38,300
and we're running out of time.

720
00:28:39,640 --> 00:28:40,770
What are we gonna do?

721
00:28:43,160 --> 00:28:44,290
What are we gonna do?

722
00:28:46,750 --> 00:28:48,030
Who got canceled?

723
00:28:55,270 --> 00:28:55,830
Brother.

724
00:28:56,240 --> 00:28:57,370
Where have you been?

725
00:28:58,240 --> 00:28:59,100
I'm not crying.

726
00:28:59,310 --> 00:29:00,110
You cried?

727
00:29:00,110 --> 00:29:00,920
I didn't go to the sugarcane field.

728
00:29:00,920 --> 00:29:02,640
You know about the sugarcane field?

729
00:29:02,640 --> 00:29:04,640
So I'm the only one who doesn't know?

730
00:29:08,790 --> 00:29:09,790
Sugarcane field?

731
00:29:11,880 --> 00:29:12,740
What happened?

732
00:29:13,480 --> 00:29:14,810
He doesn't know either.

733
00:29:14,850 --> 00:29:18,050
Shengzai was on a date
with a woman in the sugarcane field,

734
00:29:18,530 --> 00:29:19,790
and Yudan caught them.

735
00:29:21,790 --> 00:29:22,990
The woman got caught?

736
00:29:27,880 --> 00:29:29,640
I'm the only one who doesn't know.

737
00:29:29,640 --> 00:29:31,370
Why don't you ask someone else?

738
00:29:32,140 --> 00:29:33,600
That woman was not caught.

739
00:29:33,640 --> 00:29:34,840
Shengzai was caught.

740
00:29:38,240 --> 00:29:38,880
What a...

741
00:29:40,830 --> 00:29:42,030
pity.

742
00:29:42,830 --> 00:29:44,480
She ran too fast.

743
00:29:44,600 --> 00:29:45,790
We couldn't catch her.

744
00:29:45,790 --> 00:29:47,850
Now the whole village knows about it.

745
00:29:49,270 --> 00:29:50,530
What did she look like?

746
00:29:51,680 --> 00:29:52,790
Red dress,

747
00:29:53,510 --> 00:29:54,350
long hair,

748
00:29:55,000 --> 00:29:56,330
and pretty well-built.

749
00:29:57,200 --> 00:29:59,070
There's all kinds of gossip going around.

750
00:29:59,070 --> 00:29:59,530
Really?

751
00:30:00,200 --> 00:30:03,070
They're saying she's a single mom
with a kid,

752
00:30:03,550 --> 00:30:04,790
maybe older than him.

753
00:30:05,680 --> 00:30:06,880
And maybe she's a foreigner.

754
00:30:06,880 --> 00:30:07,940
From what country?

755
00:30:09,510 --> 00:30:10,770
What's wrong with you?

756
00:30:12,030 --> 00:30:13,830
Anyway, your buddy Shengzai...

757
00:30:14,750 --> 00:30:16,280
His reputation was ruined.

758
00:30:16,350 --> 00:30:17,350
Well, that Shengzai...

759
00:30:17,350 --> 00:30:18,000
When I first met him,

760
00:30:18,000 --> 00:30:19,720
I could tell he was bad news.

761
00:30:21,050 --> 00:30:23,290
Is Yudan really hurt?

762
00:30:24,750 --> 00:30:26,110
Shengzai's even worse.

763
00:30:26,620 --> 00:30:28,020
He's in the hospital now.

764
00:30:32,310 --> 00:30:33,030
Shengzai?

765
00:30:35,240 --> 00:30:35,790
Jiahao?

766
00:30:37,110 --> 00:30:38,310
You're here to see me?

767
00:30:41,510 --> 00:30:43,110
And you came empty-handed?

768
00:30:46,310 --> 00:30:47,570
I brought two oranges.

769
00:30:48,510 --> 00:30:49,570
That's something.

770
00:30:54,690 --> 00:30:56,000
Sorry, sorry.

771
00:30:59,120 --> 00:30:59,840
Shengzai,

772
00:31:00,640 --> 00:31:02,900
you've been married to Yudan for so long.

773
00:31:03,110 --> 00:31:05,110
How could she beat you up that badly?

774
00:31:05,550 --> 00:31:06,920
It wasn't just her.

775
00:31:07,920 --> 00:31:09,320
I got some of the injuries

776
00:31:09,550 --> 00:31:11,950
when I fell into a ditch
while running away.

777
00:31:15,270 --> 00:31:16,000
Jiahao.

778
00:31:17,440 --> 00:31:18,880
I'm really innocent.

779
00:31:19,830 --> 00:31:20,830
Do you believe me?

780
00:31:21,720 --> 00:31:22,680
I believe you.

781
00:31:23,920 --> 00:31:24,850
My good brother!

782
00:31:33,510 --> 00:31:34,370
Come on. You...

783
00:31:38,640 --> 00:31:40,030
I'm not lying to you.

784
00:31:40,680 --> 00:31:42,750
The way you felt just now
when I hugged you...

785
00:31:42,750 --> 00:31:43,680
was exactly the same as

786
00:31:43,680 --> 00:31:44,720
the way that woman felt

787
00:31:44,720 --> 00:31:46,980
when I hugged her in the sugarcane field.

788
00:31:48,350 --> 00:31:49,590
If you weren't a man,

789
00:31:49,920 --> 00:31:51,380
I would suspect it was you.

790
00:31:52,680 --> 00:31:53,550
Well...

791
00:31:55,240 --> 00:31:58,200
Shengzai, to be honest...

792
00:31:58,580 --> 00:31:59,960
-Actually, tonight...
-No need to persuade me.

793
00:31:59,960 --> 00:32:01,090
I've made up my mind.

794
00:32:01,240 --> 00:32:02,440
Once I'm out of the hospital,

795
00:32:02,440 --> 00:32:04,160
I'll find that woman for sure.

796
00:32:04,200 --> 00:32:05,850
I'll ask her why she trapped me.

797
00:32:05,850 --> 00:32:07,030
If she can't give me a good explanation,

798
00:32:07,030 --> 00:32:09,160
I'll plant her in the sugarcane field.

799
00:32:15,290 --> 00:32:17,030
How exactly are you planning to plant her?

800
00:32:17,030 --> 00:32:17,960
At both ends.

801
00:32:18,150 --> 00:32:21,350
Make her do the sit-and-reach
and stick her in the ground!

802
00:32:24,750 --> 00:32:27,400
Shengzai, you... You should get some rest.

803
00:32:27,880 --> 00:32:29,080
Don't think too much.

804
00:32:29,840 --> 00:32:31,360
I'll visit you later.

805
00:32:33,750 --> 00:32:34,350
Wait.

806
00:32:36,550 --> 00:32:37,280
Turn around.

807
00:32:41,270 --> 00:32:41,830
Jiahao.

808
00:32:42,830 --> 00:32:44,360
Act like you're panicking.

809
00:32:47,070 --> 00:32:48,310
Who are you?

810
00:32:49,550 --> 00:32:50,880
What did you do tonight?

811
00:32:51,110 --> 00:32:52,400
What did you do tonight?

812
00:32:52,400 --> 00:32:54,240
Your back looks exactly like that woman's!

813
00:32:54,240 --> 00:32:55,400
I...

814
00:32:55,400 --> 00:32:57,350
I've been at home!

815
00:32:57,350 --> 00:32:59,240
You suspect me?

816
00:32:59,240 --> 00:33:00,590
Besides, women have long hair.

817
00:33:00,590 --> 00:33:02,190
Mine is not that long, right?

818
00:33:02,440 --> 00:33:03,440
And she was wearing red.

819
00:33:03,440 --> 00:33:04,510
I'm wearing blue!

820
00:33:04,510 --> 00:33:07,160
I never said anything
about the red clothes.

821
00:33:11,200 --> 00:33:12,880
Well...
the whole village is talking about it.

822
00:33:12,880 --> 00:33:15,610
They're saying you were with
a woman in red and...

823
00:33:17,200 --> 00:33:18,440
The...

824
00:33:18,440 --> 00:33:19,840
The whole village knows?

825
00:33:25,830 --> 00:33:27,440
Sheng... Shengzai.

826
00:33:27,440 --> 00:33:28,350
You...

827
00:33:28,350 --> 00:33:28,830
You...

828
00:33:28,830 --> 00:33:29,440
Just get some rest.

829
00:33:29,440 --> 00:33:30,460
Don't think about it for now.

830
00:33:30,460 --> 00:33:31,240
Have an orange.

831
00:33:31,240 --> 00:33:32,110
It'll cool you down.

832
00:33:32,110 --> 00:33:33,770
I'll come see you again later.

833
00:33:34,370 --> 00:33:35,440
I'm leaving.

834
00:33:37,270 --> 00:33:40,030
Oranges are heaty!

835
00:34:02,590 --> 00:34:03,110
Don't move.

836
00:34:03,110 --> 00:34:04,170
What are you doing?

837
00:34:04,310 --> 00:34:04,880
Calm down.

838
00:34:04,880 --> 00:34:05,510
Don't... Don't get physical.

839
00:34:05,510 --> 00:34:06,200
I'll yell!

840
00:34:06,200 --> 00:34:06,790
I'll yell!

841
00:34:06,790 --> 00:34:07,240
-Stop it.
-What are you doing?

842
00:34:07,240 --> 00:34:08,040
-Go ahead.
-I…

843
00:34:10,920 --> 00:34:11,400
Bro.

844
00:34:12,070 --> 00:34:13,960
I was rude at that time.

845
00:34:15,710 --> 00:34:16,840
Let's talk this out.

846
00:34:17,000 --> 00:34:17,710
Don't get physical.

847
00:34:17,710 --> 00:34:19,370
Don't... Don't get physical.

848
00:34:19,800 --> 00:34:21,130
Don't hit my face, okay?

849
00:34:23,670 --> 00:34:24,510
Mr. Zhou.

850
00:34:27,630 --> 00:34:29,030
Mr. Zhou!

851
00:34:29,840 --> 00:34:30,920
What are you doing?

852
00:34:31,510 --> 00:34:32,110
Bow to him.

853
00:34:32,960 --> 00:34:33,630
No need.

854
00:34:33,630 --> 00:34:34,110
Bow.

855
00:34:34,110 --> 00:34:34,960
No, no, no.

856
00:34:35,960 --> 00:34:38,190
Mr. Zhou,
how did you come up with this idea?

857
00:34:38,190 --> 00:34:40,850
You lured the three of us
to the sugarcane field,

858
00:34:41,400 --> 00:34:43,280
killed three birds with one stone,

859
00:34:43,280 --> 00:34:45,320
and ruined all the actors!

860
00:34:47,000 --> 00:34:48,060
Most importantly,

861
00:34:48,280 --> 00:34:50,880
you did your job first.

862
00:34:51,150 --> 00:34:52,280
What is this called?

863
00:34:53,630 --> 00:34:54,489
Professional!

864
00:34:54,880 --> 00:34:55,400
Bro...

865
00:34:55,400 --> 00:34:57,880
And Mr. Zhou, you're really tough.

866
00:34:57,880 --> 00:34:59,860
I can outrun every dog in our village.

867
00:34:59,860 --> 00:35:02,000
But today, I couldn't catch up with you.

868
00:35:02,000 --> 00:35:03,660
You run much faster than a dog.

869
00:35:04,230 --> 00:35:05,030
Thank you.

870
00:35:06,400 --> 00:35:06,930
Mr. Zhou.

871
00:35:07,480 --> 00:35:08,320
Say no more.

872
00:35:08,800 --> 00:35:11,760
You've done your job.
I have to transfer the money to you.

873
00:35:11,760 --> 00:35:13,320
I didn't do anything for you.

874
00:35:13,320 --> 00:35:14,190
It has nothing to do with me.

875
00:35:14,190 --> 00:35:16,000
I understand. We need to be careful.

876
00:35:16,000 --> 00:35:17,510
No, I didn't do anything for you.

877
00:35:17,510 --> 00:35:18,630
Don't... I don't want your money.

878
00:35:18,630 --> 00:35:19,150
Done.

879
00:35:20,320 --> 00:35:20,850
Mr. Zhou.

880
00:35:22,000 --> 00:35:23,110
I have another request.

881
00:35:23,110 --> 00:35:25,000
I plan to hire you in the future

882
00:35:26,790 --> 00:35:27,910
to work for me.

883
00:35:28,000 --> 00:35:29,800
Work exclusively for me.
Money's not a problem.

884
00:35:29,800 --> 00:35:30,960
I'm not working for you.

885
00:35:30,960 --> 00:35:31,320
I understand.

886
00:35:31,320 --> 00:35:32,430
You had to give me the money.

887
00:35:32,430 --> 00:35:33,150
I didn't ask for it.

888
00:35:33,150 --> 00:35:34,880
Do the job first, then get paid.

889
00:35:35,230 --> 00:35:35,920
No, I...

890
00:35:35,920 --> 00:35:36,590
You had to give me the money, and I...

891
00:35:36,590 --> 00:35:37,480
A gesture of kindness.

892
00:35:37,480 --> 00:35:38,590
Help!

893
00:35:39,280 --> 00:35:39,810
Ms. Zhen?

894
00:35:41,360 --> 00:35:41,840
Zhen?

895
00:35:42,840 --> 00:35:43,970
I missed you so much.

896
00:35:44,630 --> 00:35:45,320
Zhen, I...

897
00:35:46,070 --> 00:35:46,670
Careful!

898
00:35:46,670 --> 00:35:47,270
Zhen, I...

899
00:35:47,590 --> 00:35:48,440
Don't, Zhen!

900
00:35:48,840 --> 00:35:50,000
I missed you, Zhen!

901
00:35:50,480 --> 00:35:51,280
I really missed you!

902
00:35:51,280 --> 00:35:51,670
Zhen!

903
00:35:53,320 --> 00:35:54,780
I really missed you, Zhen!

904
00:35:54,920 --> 00:35:55,280
Zhen!

905
00:36:00,400 --> 00:36:01,920
Mr. Zhou, are you okay?

906
00:36:01,950 --> 00:36:03,110
If I hadn't come,

907
00:36:03,110 --> 00:36:03,920
you would have...

908
00:36:03,920 --> 00:36:04,230
I...

909
00:36:04,230 --> 00:36:05,110
I'm fine. I'm good.

910
00:36:05,110 --> 00:36:05,960
Are you okay?

911
00:36:06,440 --> 00:36:07,230
I'm fine.

912
00:36:07,510 --> 00:36:09,070
Try not to come out alone.

913
00:36:09,360 --> 00:36:10,280
I...

914
00:36:10,960 --> 00:36:11,980
Awesome, awesome.

915
00:36:11,980 --> 00:36:13,230
Put on your shoes.

916
00:36:13,280 --> 00:36:14,340
Where are my shoes?

917
00:36:16,290 --> 00:36:17,220
Forget about it.

918
00:36:17,230 --> 00:36:17,920
Well, Mr. Zhou,

919
00:36:17,920 --> 00:36:19,580
what are you doing here alone?

920
00:36:22,590 --> 00:36:23,320
I'm just

921
00:36:23,960 --> 00:36:26,480
thinking about the next step.

922
00:36:27,760 --> 00:36:29,070
Have you figured it out?

923
00:36:29,070 --> 00:36:29,630
Yes.

924
00:36:31,400 --> 00:36:32,800
We don't have actors now.

925
00:36:32,880 --> 00:36:33,510
Let's get new actors.

926
00:36:33,510 --> 00:36:34,240
It's normal.

927
00:36:34,800 --> 00:36:35,550
Who can we get?

928
00:36:35,550 --> 00:36:36,590
Don't we have so many

929
00:36:36,590 --> 00:36:38,590
colorful villagers in our village?

930
00:36:38,670 --> 00:36:40,510
Didn't you say they couldn't do it?

931
00:36:40,510 --> 00:36:41,110
Did I?

932
00:36:42,150 --> 00:36:43,280
No, I didn't.

933
00:36:43,280 --> 00:36:45,030
They're great.
Everyone has their own charm.

934
00:36:45,030 --> 00:36:46,760
You just need an eye for beauty.

935
00:36:47,230 --> 00:36:48,070
A rough diamond

936
00:36:48,070 --> 00:36:50,330
needs to be polished before it can shine.

937
00:36:50,360 --> 00:36:52,030
Put a lump of clay in Da Vinci's hands,

938
00:36:52,030 --> 00:36:53,840
and he can turn it into Venus,

939
00:36:54,040 --> 00:36:56,040
The Thinker, David, and so on.

940
00:36:57,360 --> 00:36:58,290
What do you mean?

941
00:37:00,630 --> 00:37:01,630
Just wait and see.

942
00:37:02,070 --> 00:37:02,870
Leave it to me.

943
00:37:05,150 --> 00:37:05,480
Okay.

944
00:37:07,730 --> 00:37:09,960
[Three Days Left]

945
00:37:13,070 --> 00:37:14,590
Three, two, one. Action!

946
00:37:17,590 --> 00:37:19,760
Lei, can you stop
spinning that handkerchief?

947
00:37:19,760 --> 00:37:21,030
Alright,

948
00:37:20,260 --> 00:37:22,720
♪ I'm a b-b-boy ♪

949
00:37:21,030 --> 00:37:21,630
I'll stop.

950
00:37:22,750 --> 00:37:24,930
♪ Who s-s-smiles all day ♪

951
00:37:23,920 --> 00:37:25,050
Where are you going?

952
00:37:25,050 --> 00:37:26,520
♪ Even with big, big troubles ♪

953
00:37:25,700 --> 00:37:26,150
Wait!

954
00:37:26,150 --> 00:37:26,840
Cut!

955
00:37:26,550 --> 00:37:28,700
♪ I'll laugh and curse them away ♪

956
00:37:28,550 --> 00:37:29,680
How is it? Is it okay?

957
00:37:29,960 --> 00:37:31,380
♪ Life will always ♪

958
00:37:31,410 --> 00:37:32,690
♪ Give you an Oscar ♪

959
00:37:32,720 --> 00:37:34,470
♪ For the role you play ♪

960
00:37:32,960 --> 00:37:34,360
Can't you just not work?

961
00:37:34,730 --> 00:37:36,020
♪ Be the king of comedy ♪

962
00:37:35,440 --> 00:37:36,110
What?

963
00:37:36,040 --> 00:37:38,690
♪ We're all on the same stage ♪

964
00:37:37,710 --> 00:37:38,550
Where are you going?

965
00:37:38,550 --> 00:37:39,440
What do you want?

966
00:37:39,440 --> 00:37:41,920
No! I can't stop!

967
00:37:42,360 --> 00:37:43,670
Will you support me?

968
00:37:45,070 --> 00:37:45,550
Hey.

969
00:37:46,230 --> 00:37:47,150
You're leaving?

970
00:37:47,150 --> 00:37:48,410
I'm a little drunk now.

971
00:37:49,760 --> 00:37:51,030
Can't you just not work?

972
00:37:50,390 --> 00:37:51,840
♪ The book says, "The journey is long" ♪

973
00:37:51,150 --> 00:37:52,480
Can't you just not work?

974
00:37:52,330 --> 00:37:54,110
♪ So I keep seeking the truth ♪

975
00:37:52,480 --> 00:37:53,760
If my boss tells me not to work,

976
00:37:53,760 --> 00:37:54,760
I won't work.

977
00:37:54,510 --> 00:37:58,930
♪ Is climbing stairs
a way of growing up? ♪

978
00:37:59,510 --> 00:38:01,670
♪ Rolling and crawling ♪

979
00:38:00,670 --> 00:38:01,150
Hey!

980
00:38:01,920 --> 00:38:04,350
♪ We'll eventually reach the destination ♪

981
00:38:04,380 --> 00:38:08,860
♪ Whether it's home
or somewhere far away ♪

982
00:38:09,150 --> 00:38:10,360
I'll support you!

983
00:38:09,440 --> 00:38:13,550
♪ Oh, sometimes I get scared ♪

984
00:38:12,800 --> 00:38:14,360
Take care of the fool!

985
00:38:14,020 --> 00:38:18,550
♪ That all my big talk
will turn into a joke ♪

986
00:38:15,400 --> 00:38:16,110
I mean you!

987
00:38:19,210 --> 00:38:21,620
♪ But luckily, my laughter's powerful ♪

988
00:38:19,550 --> 00:38:20,000
You...

989
00:38:21,190 --> 00:38:21,590
Here!

990
00:38:21,660 --> 00:38:23,710
♪ And contagious ♪

991
00:38:22,800 --> 00:38:23,400
Yourself!

992
00:38:23,670 --> 00:38:24,150
Look over there.

993
00:38:23,820 --> 00:38:28,000
♪ Let's wipe the tears dry and ha-ha-ha ♪

994
00:38:24,710 --> 00:38:25,590
There.

995
00:38:26,480 --> 00:38:26,960
Here!

996
00:38:28,960 --> 00:38:31,480
You'd better
take care of yourself first, idiot!

997
00:38:29,090 --> 00:38:31,690
♪ I'm just a little ♪

998
00:38:31,710 --> 00:38:33,660
♪ Just a little kid ♪

999
00:38:32,510 --> 00:38:33,190
Fool.

1000
00:38:33,870 --> 00:38:35,430
♪ I have a dream ♪

1001
00:38:35,450 --> 00:38:38,410
♪ And I dream big ♪

1002
00:38:38,030 --> 00:38:39,070
What do you think?

1003
00:38:39,190 --> 00:38:40,210
♪ The most common ♪

1004
00:38:40,000 --> 00:38:40,760
Well...

1005
00:38:40,230 --> 00:38:41,820
♪ Dramatic trick ♪

1006
00:38:40,760 --> 00:38:42,320
Can you do it or not?

1007
00:38:41,840 --> 00:38:43,570
♪ Is break down to build up ♪

1008
00:38:42,320 --> 00:38:43,280
We've filmed so many times!

1009
00:38:43,280 --> 00:38:45,030
Let's try two more times and see.

1010
00:38:43,940 --> 00:38:45,170
♪ Little figures ♪

1011
00:38:45,200 --> 00:38:47,920
♪ Can also be the best ♪

1012
00:38:45,280 --> 00:38:46,320
I'm not filming!

1013
00:38:46,320 --> 00:38:47,360
Don't, Qingxia!

1014
00:38:48,710 --> 00:38:49,320
Qingxia!

1015
00:38:48,790 --> 00:38:51,110
♪ I'm a b-b-boy ♪

1016
00:38:49,320 --> 00:38:50,190
Qingxia! Qingxia!

1017
00:38:50,190 --> 00:38:50,510
Qingxia!

1018
00:38:50,510 --> 00:38:51,360
Qingxia!

1019
00:38:51,310 --> 00:38:53,400
♪ Who s-s-smiles all day ♪

1020
00:38:51,360 --> 00:38:51,880
Wait!

1021
00:38:51,960 --> 00:38:52,960
Qingxia!

1022
00:38:53,670 --> 00:38:54,280
Don't be angry!

1023
00:38:53,880 --> 00:38:55,150
♪ Even with big, big troubles ♪

1024
00:38:54,280 --> 00:38:55,630
Let's take a few more shots. It's okay.

1025
00:38:55,170 --> 00:38:58,090
♪ I'll laugh and curse them away ♪

1026
00:38:56,070 --> 00:38:57,070
Mr. Zhou can teach you

1027
00:38:57,070 --> 00:38:59,000
the lines!

1028
00:38:58,480 --> 00:38:59,520
♪ Life will always ♪

1029
00:38:59,320 --> 00:38:59,710
Alright?

1030
00:38:59,550 --> 00:39:00,870
♪ Give you an Oscar ♪

1031
00:39:00,320 --> 00:39:01,590
Mr. Zhou, say something!

1032
00:39:00,900 --> 00:39:02,640
♪ For the role you play ♪

1033
00:39:02,480 --> 00:39:04,280
Mr. Zhou can teach you. Am I right?

1034
00:39:02,960 --> 00:39:04,360
♪ Be the king of comedy ♪

1035
00:39:04,380 --> 00:39:07,560
♪ We're all on the same stage ♪

1036
00:39:05,760 --> 00:39:06,800
Yes. Right.

1037
00:39:06,800 --> 00:39:07,920
We can adjust it a little.

1038
00:39:07,920 --> 00:39:08,760
One more time.

1039
00:39:09,230 --> 00:39:10,430
I won't film anymore!

1040
00:39:11,030 --> 00:39:11,670
Come on, Qingxia!

1041
00:39:11,670 --> 00:39:12,710
Why don't you do two more takes?

1042
00:39:12,710 --> 00:39:14,190
It's better to tear down the houses!

1043
00:39:14,190 --> 00:39:15,440
We can at least get some money!

1044
00:39:15,440 --> 00:39:17,240
Zhen, you're being ridiculous!

1045
00:39:17,590 --> 00:39:19,280
The people you hired are not professional!

1046
00:39:19,280 --> 00:39:21,320
You're just messing around with everyone!

1047
00:39:21,320 --> 00:39:22,190
Let's go!

1048
00:39:22,190 --> 00:39:22,710
Uncle!

1049
00:39:22,960 --> 00:39:24,150
Can you do it or not?

1050
00:39:24,150 --> 00:39:25,230
Come on!

1051
00:39:25,670 --> 00:39:27,000
Let's try one more time!

1052
00:39:27,000 --> 00:39:28,030
Right. Let's go back and farm.

1053
00:39:28,030 --> 00:39:29,890
They are not professional at all.

1054
00:39:31,360 --> 00:39:32,020
Mr. Haidan.

1055
00:39:32,190 --> 00:39:32,920
Well done.

1056
00:39:33,070 --> 00:39:33,600
Good job.

1057
00:39:34,030 --> 00:39:35,090
Give me back my hat.

1058
00:39:36,440 --> 00:39:37,440
Give it back to me.

1059
00:39:40,480 --> 00:39:41,150
Well done.

1060
00:39:41,400 --> 00:39:42,360
You're a talented actor.

1061
00:39:42,360 --> 00:39:43,030
Come on!

1062
00:39:43,030 --> 00:39:43,900
Why don't you do two more takes?

1063
00:39:43,900 --> 00:39:45,100
Yeah! Two more takes!

1064
00:39:45,110 --> 00:39:47,230
So annoying!

1065
00:39:48,920 --> 00:39:50,670
He's really talented.

1066
00:39:51,280 --> 00:39:52,300
Mr. Zhou, it's okay.

1067
00:39:52,300 --> 00:39:54,480
They must be tired.

1068
00:39:54,710 --> 00:39:56,590
L-Let's do
another round of auditions later.

1069
00:39:56,590 --> 00:39:57,480
If that really doesn't work,

1070
00:39:57,480 --> 00:39:58,880
my brother and I can do it.

1071
00:39:59,840 --> 00:40:01,370
Let's give it another shot.

1072
00:40:01,590 --> 00:40:03,050
Don't you always pass out?

1073
00:40:03,280 --> 00:40:04,070
That's okay.

1074
00:40:04,070 --> 00:40:07,200
I'll take some motion sickness pills
and power through.

1075
00:40:14,400 --> 00:40:15,060
I'll say it.

1076
00:40:17,440 --> 00:40:18,550
At this point,

1077
00:40:19,070 --> 00:40:20,480
we've all done our best.

1078
00:40:20,480 --> 00:40:21,760
Don't blame yourself too much.

1079
00:40:21,760 --> 00:40:23,190
But having said that,

1080
00:40:23,360 --> 00:40:24,890
I want to confirm one thing.

1081
00:40:25,230 --> 00:40:26,710
We agreed before

1082
00:40:26,880 --> 00:40:29,710
that if we pull it off,
we'd get one amount,

1083
00:40:30,190 --> 00:40:31,880
and if we don't,

1084
00:40:32,360 --> 00:40:35,020
we'd at least
have a guaranteed minimum, right?

1085
00:40:36,360 --> 00:40:37,090
That's good.

1086
00:40:38,190 --> 00:40:40,320
So no matter
whether we pull it off or not,

1087
00:40:40,320 --> 00:40:42,800
we'll definitely get that minimum, right?

1088
00:40:43,280 --> 00:40:44,210
What do you mean?

1089
00:40:44,880 --> 00:40:45,630
Nothing.

1090
00:40:45,630 --> 00:40:46,800
I'm just asking.

1091
00:40:47,190 --> 00:40:49,300
Anyway, we've still got a few days.

1092
00:40:49,400 --> 00:40:51,960
If you want to keep filming,
we'll do it with you.

1093
00:40:51,960 --> 00:40:52,920
But...

1094
00:40:53,630 --> 00:40:54,880
as the saying goes,

1095
00:40:55,070 --> 00:40:57,400
even if a deal falls through,
we don't have to fall out.

1096
00:40:57,400 --> 00:40:57,920
We...

1097
00:40:58,880 --> 00:40:59,320
We...

1098
00:41:00,550 --> 00:41:01,950
We're lifelong friends.

1099
00:41:11,720 --> 00:41:13,310
I'll give you the money.

1100
00:41:13,590 --> 00:41:14,320
That's good.

1101
00:41:14,630 --> 00:41:15,630
You must be tired.

1102
00:41:15,800 --> 00:41:16,600
Get some rest.

1103
00:41:17,230 --> 00:41:17,800
Okay.

1104
00:41:18,150 --> 00:41:19,210
You should also...

1105
00:41:20,800 --> 00:41:23,440
I'm not saying
we have to get the money or anything.

1106
00:41:23,440 --> 00:41:24,930
Let me think about it.

1107
00:41:25,480 --> 00:41:26,670
I'll try to fix them.

1108
00:41:26,800 --> 00:41:28,070
I'll use a new acting method.
